Sorry about the follow up bit but I can't find the original message!
I have been running nethack 3.0 under windows in enhanced mode and have not
had any problems with it not finding the overlays. The properties for the icon
are just
PROG NAME nethack.pif
STARTUP DIR c:\games\nethack

and then I have the PIF setup accordingly and all runs ok. Including NH in a
nice small window or full screen.
I think the above is correct, I certainly don't have it my AUTOEXEC path or
have a batch file.
